{
  "file": "module4",
  "page": 152,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        66.76272583007812,
        236.92332458496094,
        82.6147232055664
      ],
      "text": "Acquisition of drug resistance",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        89.82263946533203,
        527.4388427734375,
        104.26564025878906
      ],
      "text": "The analysis suggested that amplification of resistance to rifampicin was lower in patients receiving",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        103.02259063720703,
        527.3945922851562,
        117.46559143066406
      ],
      "text": "the 6(H)REZ regimen (0.6%) than in those receiving >6(H)REZ (4.3%). This observation could be due",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        116.22272491455078,
        527.414794921875,
        130.6657257080078
      ],
      "text": "to the selection and allocation of patients into specific regimens; for instance, the number of patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.42274475097656,
        527.3959350585938,
        143.86573791503906
      ],
      "text": "with extensive disease was slightly larger in those receiving >6(H)REZ. However, overall, the number",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        142.62269592285156,
        527.4136352539062,
        157.06568908691406
      ],
      "text": "of observations for each comparison was small and the effect was not statistically significant (aOR,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        155.8227081298828,
        180.30508422851562,
        170.2657012939453
      ],
      "text": "0.2, 95% CL: 0.02–1.70).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        183.64004516601562,
        153.88450622558594,
        199.49203491210938
      ],
      "text": "Adverse events",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        206.6999053955078,
        527.4056396484375,
        221.1428985595703
      ],
      "text": "Data on adverse events were not evaluated owing to a lack of standardization (dissimilar reporting).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        219.89991760253906,
        527.5484008789062,
        234.34291076660156
      ],
      "text": "The GDG also considered two reports containing data from patients from the United States of America",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963639259338379,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        233.0998077392578,
        527.4988403320312,
        247.5428009033203
      ],
      "text": "(USA) in whom a detailed assessment of adverse events suggested a risk of excess hepatotoxicity with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.983988761901855,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        245.02394104003906,
        527.4260864257812,
        260.7429504394531
      ],
      "text": "(100) the 6(H)REZ combination  . Drug-induced hepatotoxicity is not uncommon with anti-TB drugs.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        259.4998779296875,
        527.4036865234375,
        273.9429016113281
      ],
      "text": "It has also been reported in individuals receiving rifampicin and pyrazinamide for 2 months for the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        272.69989013671875,
        527.3905029296875,
        287.1429138183594
      ],
      "text": "treatment of TB infection – in such individuals, a much higher occurrence of hepatotoxicity has been",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        284.6239013671875,
        527.4425659179688,
        300.3429260253906
      ],
      "text": "(101) observed than in those receiving only isoniazid preventive therapy  . It is not known whether the",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        299.09979248046875,
        321.8046875,
        313.5428161621094
      ],
      "text": "risk of hepatotoxicity differs between 6REZ and 6HREZ.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        326.9171142578125,
        237.4777374267578,
        342.76910400390625
      ],
      "text": "Addition of a fluoroquinolone",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        349.9770202636719,
        527.4036254882812,
        364.4200439453125
      ],
      "text": "In patients with Hr-TB, treatment success rates were higher when fluoroquinolones were added to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        363.177001953125,
        527.4365234375,
        377.6200256347656
      ],
      "text": "(H)REZ regimens than when patients were treated with 6(H)REZ or >6(H)REZ, without the addition",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        376.37701416015625,
        527.3980712890625,
        390.8200378417969
      ],
      "text": "of fluoroquinolones (aOR: 2.8, 95% CL: 1.1–7.3). With the addition of fluoroquinolones in patients",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        389.5771179199219,
        527.5786743164062,
        404.0201416015625
      ],
      "text": "receiving (H)REZ, the number of deaths was reduced (aOR: 0.4, 95% CL: 0.2–1.1). Acquisition of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        402.7770080566406,
        527.58740234375,
        417.22003173828125
      ],
      "text": "additional resistance with progression to MDR-TB was also reduced when fluoroquinolones were",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        415.9770202636719,
        527.5223999023438,
        430.4200439453125
      ],
      "text": "added to a ≥6(H)REZ regimen (aOR: 0.10, 95% CL: 0.01–1.2), albeit with small absolute numbers; 0.5%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.964492797851562,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        429.177001953125,
        527.5165405273438,
        443.6200256347656
      ],
      "text": "(1/221) of patients on ≥6(H)REZ plus fluoroquinolones acquired resistance to rifampicin compared with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.951994895935059,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        442.37701416015625,
        527.4212646484375,
        456.8200378417969
      ],
      "text": "3.8% (44/1160) of patients who did not receive fluoroquinolones. Residual confounding could have",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        455.5771179199219,
        527.4432373046875,
        470.0201416015625
      ],
      "text": "increased this observed effect. The directness of the evidence was therefore downgraded because",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        468.7770080566406,
        527.4067993164062,
        483.22003173828125
      ],
      "text": "it was unclear whether fluoroquinolones were used at the beginning of treatment or only once DST",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.9770202636719,
        310.2261047363281,
        496.4200439453125
      ],
      "text": "results were available (in the second month or later).",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        509.7942810058594,
        209.9173126220703,
        525.6463012695312
      ],
      "text": "Addition of streptomycin",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        532.854248046875,
        527.4268188476562,
        547.2972412109375
      ],
      "text": "The analysis showed that the addition of streptomycin (up to 3 months) to an (H)REZ regimen with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        546.05419921875,
        527.42236328125,
        560.4971923828125
      ],
      "text": "less than 4 months of pyrazinamide decreased the likelihood of treatment success (aOR: 0.4, 95%",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        559.2542114257812,
        527.3795776367188,
        573.6972045898438
      ],
      "text": "CL: 0.2–0.7), an effect that may in part be due to confounding. The addition of streptomycin did not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        572.34423828125,
        527.270751953125,
        586.897216796875
      ],
      "text": "Annex 6 significantly reduce mortality (see  ). There were no data on the use of other injectable agents",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 10.981884956359863,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.6541748046875,
        398.7035827636719,
        600.09716796875
      ],
      "text": "(i.e., kanamycin, amikacin, and capreomycin) for the treatment of Hr-TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        613.4713745117188,
        185.06886291503906,
        629.3234252929688
      ],
      "text": "Treatment outcomes",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        636.5313720703125,
        527.480712890625,
        650.974365234375
      ],
      "text": "When analysing the overall treatment outcomes for each one of the regimens assessed for this review,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.972916603088379,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        649.7313842773438,
        527.3837280273438,
        664.1743774414062
      ],
      "text": "other limitations related to the characteristics of patients included in these studies were evident and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        662.931396484375,
        527.2924194335938,
        677.3743896484375
      ],
      "text": "could not be controlled for. Those limitations were patient selection, and allocation to treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        676.1312866210938,
        527.4078369140625,
        690.5742797851562
      ],
      "text": "with specific regimens and their relationship with disease severity. Outcomes appeared to be worse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        689.3314208984375,
        527.3848266601562,
        703.7744140625
      ],
      "text": "in patients with cavitary disease, persistence of sputum smear positivity and previous history of TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        702.5313720703125,
        527.540283203125,
        716.974365234375
      ],
      "text": "treatment, who received a 6(H)REZ or >6(H)REZ regimen with an additional 3 months of pyrazinamide",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.965445518493652,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        715.6213989257812,
        527.406005859375,
        730.1743774414062
      ],
      "text": "Annex 5 and 1–3 months of streptomycin (see Hr-TB, 2018 in  ). However, the limited number of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        728.931396484375,
        527.4378662109375,
        743.3743896484375
      ],
      "text": "observations made it difficult to draw definitive conclusions based on the severity of TB disease or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        742.1312866210938,
        298.5364685058594,
        756.5742797851562
      ],
      "text": "the effect of other comorbidities on this regimen.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        39.172698974609375,
        801.0170288085938,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "138 WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        136.43649291992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        170.0604705810547,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "guidelines",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        172.25680541992188,
        801.0170288085938,
        326.14483642578125,
        811.52099609375
      ],
      "text": "on tuberculosis: Module 4: treatment and care",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
